      <title>Version 3.3.3</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 09:45:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>File formats as toggle pills, grouped by Image, Document and Media</li><li>Related extensions switch on together (e.g. LibreOffice: odt, ods, odp, odf)</li><li>Rarer formats tucked under "More formats"</li></ul>]]></description>
