      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Name card now hangs on a real rope: grab the card or the lanyard, drag and throw it</li><li>Card tilts towards the mouse; click to flip it</li><li>Pull it far to the right and it spins a full 360°</li></ul>]]></description>
